## Rate Limiting




### Request


```json
{
  "id": "b1b61f11-d34b-408b-ba46-cd6c1907252b",
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "result": {
    "rate_limit": {
      "limit": 1000,
      "remaining": 750,
      "reset": 1685373600
    },
    "service_name": "example-api"
  }
}
}
```

### Response

There are 3 X-RateLimit-> Limit, Remaining, Reset

Name | Type | Description
--------- | ------- | -----------
Limit | number | The maximum number of requests allowed in the current rate limit window
Remaining |number  | 	The number of requests remaining in the current rate limit window.
Reset      |number |The time at which the current rate limit window resets in UNIX epoch seconds (UTC timestamp).

# Subscription & Billing (Prime)

##Subscription_Plans

Retrieve the current subscription plan and usage details.



### Request



```json



{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "unique-request-id",
  "result": {
    "plan": {
      "id": "basic-monthly",
      "name": "Basic Monthly",
      "features": ["feature1", "feature2"],
      "price": 1999,
      "currency": "INR",
      "status": "active",
      "usage": {
        "current_period_start": 1683004800,
        "current_period_end": 1685596800,
        "used_units": 120,
        "total_units": 1000
      }
    }
  }
}

```

### Response
| Name                              | Type    | Description                                     |
| --------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| plan                              | Object  | Subscription plan details                       |
| plan.id                           | string  | Unique plan identifier                          |
| plan.name                         | string  | Plan display name                               |
| plan.features                     | array   | List of plan features                           |
| plan.price                        | integer | Price in smallest currency unit (e.g., paise)   |
| plan.currency                     | string  | Currency code (e.g., INR, USD)                  |
| plan.status                       | string  | Current subscription status (active, cancelled) |
| plan.usage                        | Object  | Usage details within the current billing period |
| plan.usage.current\_period\_start | integer | Unix timestamp (seconds) for period start       |
| plan.usage.current\_period\_end   | integer | Unix timestamp (seconds) for period end         |
| plan.usage.used\_units            | integer | Number of units consumed                        |
| plan.usage.total\_units           | integer | Total units allowed in the period               |

