#Jobs & Custom Pipelines (Prime Enterprise)

## POST/v1/jobs

This API is used to fetch token swap quotes for a given trading pair.



```json
{
    "id": "cd728c5d-b8ca-40ee-a9cf-895a91cf2571",
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "POST/v1/jobs",
    "params": {
        "job_name": "Custom Price Feed",
        "schedule": "0 0 * * *",
        "parameters": {
          "feedId": "feed123",
          "filters": ["filter1", "filter2"]
        }
      }
}
```
### Request

| Name       | Type   | Description                        |
| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------------- |
| job\_name  | string | Name of the job                    |
| schedule   | string | Cron expression for job scheduling |
| parameters | object | Job-specific parameters            |

### Response

```json
{
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "id": "cd728c5d-b8ca-40ee-a9cf-895a91cf2571",
    "result": {
        "job_id": "job_abc123",
        "status": "created"
      }
}
```
| Name    | Type   | Description                     |
| ------- | ------ | ------------------------------- |
| job\_id | string | Unique identifier for the job   |
| status  | string | Job creation status ("created") |


