## Verifiable Randomness (VRF)

### Request Randomness

```http
POST /v1/vrf/requests
```

Request:

```json
{
    "consumerId": "my-app",
    "numWords": 1,
    "confirmationCount": 3,
    "callbackUrl": "https://my-app.com/vrf-callback"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
    "requestId": "vrf_123",
    "status": "pending",
    "requestedAt": "2024-03-19T16:00:00Z"
}
```

### Check Request Status

```http
GET /v1/vrf/requests/{requestId}
```

Response:

```json
{
    "requestId": "vrf_123",
    "status": "fulfilled",
    "randomWords": ["0x1234..."],
    "proof": "0x5678...",
    "fulfilledAt": "2024-03-19T16:01:00Z"
}
```

