| created\_at   | integer | Unix timestamp of proposal creation                         |
| voting\_start | integer | Unix timestamp of voting start                              |
| voting\_end   | integer | Unix timestamp of voting end                                |


##Create Proposals

Create governance proposals.


```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
